 otherwise — which convey dual meanings). These may consist of one or more symbols com\xadposing but a single word, or of entire sentences which have dual meanings. The latter most often display their dual meanings through homophones,9 to which we have had recourse in our Hor Sensen Papyrus investigations."'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2800, 'temperature': 0.2})
